Note on the algorithm:
The Karplus-Strong and Extended Karplus-Strong algorithms described and 
implemented in this project were originally published in Computer Music Journal 
(MIT Press, 1983). The original patents have expired and the algorithm is freely 
implementable. The academic papers remain under their respective copyrights.

Note on the archive content:
The historical documentation (README, PDF archive, in-app archive) is released 
under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).
